# 默认按文本处理，检出时统一 LF，避免 Windows / macOS 协作出现整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf

# 二进制资源
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary

# 让 GitHub 语言统计忽略纯文档仓库的噪声
*.svg linguist-documentation
